 as required.\",\"Configured gates passed: pnpm --filter pi-lhc verify, pnpm --filter pi-lhc verify-all, and the broader pnpm --filter lhc verify all completed successfully.\"],\"productionPathFindings\":[\"No fake adapter was found in production capture/fork paths: capture uses real LHC intakeStream, fork seeding reads source events and writes target events through intakeStream.messageEvents, and inspect reads real LHC surfaces.\",\"Test-only model-call fakes are confined to packages/pi-lhc/test/fixtures and are not production code.\",\"createModelCall does not fabricate completion text when @earendil-works/pi-ai is unavailable; it returns a classified failure.\",\"Material non-real verification path: packages/pi-lhc/test/fixtures/pi-corpora/*.jsonl are simplified AgentMessage rows, and packages/pi-lhc/test/fixtures/corpus.ts hand-builds expected events instead of replaying recorded PI hook/lifecycle corpora.\"],\"blockingFindings\":[{\"id\":\"EV-001\",\"severity\":\"major\",\"title\":\"Capture verification does not use recorded PI corpora\",\"evidence\":\"docs/specs/02-pi-lhc/01-connector-core/epic.md:229-231 requires recorded PI corpus replay, including chatty/tool-heavy/parallel-tool/error-result/aborted-turn corpora. packages/pi-lhc/test/fixtures/pi-corpora/chatty.jsonl and tool-heavy.jsonl contain plain AgentMessage rows with no PI hook metadata or lifecycle events, while packages/pi-lhc/test/fixtures/corpus.ts:27-38 hand-builds the expected LHC events for chatty.\",\"affectedFiles\":[\"docs/specs/02-pi-lhc/01-connector-core/epic.md\",\"packages/pi-lhc/test/fixtures/corpus.ts\",\"packages/pi-lhc/test/fixtures/pi-corpora/chatty.jsonl\",\"packages/pi-lhc/test/fixtures/pi-corpora/tool-heavy.jsonl\",\"packages/pi-lhc/test/fixtures/pi-corpora/parallel-tool.jsonl\",\"packages/pi-lhc/test/fixtures/pi-corpora/error-result.jsonl\",\"packages/pi-lhc/test/fixtures/pi-corpora/aborted-turn.jsonl\",\"packages/pi-lhc/src/verify/replay.ts\",\"packages/pi-lhc/test/verify/repla