es events/messages/turns, but it does not consume recorded PI corpora as required.\",\"Configured gates passed: pnpm --filter pi-lhc verify, pnpm --filter pi-lhc verify-all, and the broader pnpm --filter lhc verify all completed successfully.\"],\"productionPathFindings\":[\"No fake adapter was found in production capture/fork paths: capture uses real LHC intakeStream, fork seeding reads source events and writes target events through intakeStream.messageEvents, and inspect reads real LHC surfaces.\",\"Test-only model-call fakes are confined to packages/pi-lhc/test/fixtures and are not production code.\",\"createModelCall does not fabricate completion text when @earendil-works/pi-ai is unavailable; it returns a classified failure.\",\"Material non-real verification path: packages/pi-lhc/test/fixtures/pi-corpora/*.jsonl are simplified AgentMessage rows, and packages/pi-lhc/test/fixtures/corpus.ts hand-builds expected events instead of replaying recorded PI hook/lifecycle corpora.\"],\"blockingFindings\":[{\"id\":\"EV-001\",\"severity\":\"major\",\"title\":\"Capture verification does not use recorded PI corpora\",\"evidence\":\"docs/specs/02-pi-lhc/01-connector-core/epic.md:229-231 requires recorded PI corpus replay, including chatty/tool-heavy/parallel-tool/error-result/aborted-turn corpora. packages/pi-lhc/test/fixtures/pi-corpora/chatty.jsonl and tool-heavy.jsonl contain plain AgentMessage rows with no PI hook metadata or lifecycle events, while packages/pi-lhc/test/fixtures/corpus.ts:27-38 hand-builds the expected LHC events for chatty.\",\"affectedFiles\":[\"docs/specs/02-pi-lhc/01-connector-core/epic.md\",\"packages/pi-lhc/test/fixtures/corpus.ts\",\"packages/pi-lhc/test/fixtures/pi-corpora/chatty.jsonl\",\"packages/pi-lhc/test/fixtures/pi-corpora/tool-heavy.jsonl\",\"packages/pi-lhc/test/fixtures/pi-corpora/parallel-tool.jsonl\",\"packages/pi-lhc/test/fixtures/pi-corpora/error-result.jsonl\",\"packages/pi-lhc/test/fixtures/pi-corpora/aborted-turn.jsonl\",\"packages/pi-lhc/src/verify/replay.ts\",\"packages/pi-lhc/test/verify/replay.test.ts\"],\"requirementIds\":[\"AC-6.1\",\"TC-6.1\",\"A-2\"],\"recommendedFixScope\":\"fresh-fix-path\",\"blocking\":true},{\"id\":\"EV-002\",\"severity\":\"major\",\"title\":\"Reload can attach the wrong thread for no-flag and resume launches\",\"evidence\":\"docs/specs/02-pi-lhc/01-connector-core/epic.md:137 requires reload to reconstruct from durable state, the resolved thread id, and continue on the same thread. packages/pi-lhc/src/lifecycle/thread-resolution.ts:131-147 lists cwd threads and returns the last row for no-flag and --resume reloads; packages/pi-lhc/test/lifecycle/thread-resolution.test.ts:373-410 only proves the same-thread case when no newer cwd thread exists.\",\"affectedFiles\":[\"docs/specs/02-pi-lhc/01-connector-core/epic.md\",\"docs/specs/02-pi-lhc/01-connector-core/tech-design.md\",\"packages/pi-lhc/src/lifecycle/thread-resolution.ts\",\"packages/pi-lhc/src/index.ts\",\"packages/pi-lhc/test/lifecycle/thread-resolution.test.ts\"],\"requirementIds\":[\"AC-1.5\",\"TC-1.5\"],\"recommendedFixScope\":\"human-ruling\",\"blocking\":true}],\"nonBlockingFindings\":[{\"id\":\"NF-001\",\"severity\":\"observation\",\"title\":\"Configured gates pass\",\"evidence\":\"Ran pnpm --filter pi-lhc verify, pnpm --filter pi-lhc verify-all, and pnpm --filter lhc verify. pi-lhc reported 20 test files and 144 tests passing; lhc reported 41 test files passing with 389 passed and 9 skipped.\",\"affectedFiles\":[\"packages/pi-lhc/package.json\",\"packages/lhc/package.json\"],\"requirementIds\":[],\"recommendedFixScope\":\"same-session-implementor\",\"blocking\":false},{\"id\":\"NF-002\",\"severity\":\"observation\",\"title\":\"Local PI and pi-ai declarations remain a packaging boundary\",\"evidence\":\"packages/pi-lhc/src/pi/types.ts declares the consumed PI API slice locally, and packages/pi-lhc/src/inference/pi-ai.ts declares the pi-ai completion type because @earendil-works packages are not workspace dependencies. packages/pi-lhc/src/inference/model-call.ts:79-86 dynamically imports @earendil-works/pi-ai at runtime.\",\"affectedFiles\":[\"packages/pi-lhc/src/pi/types.ts\",\"packages/pi-lhc/src/inference/pi-ai.ts\",\"packages/pi-lhc/src/inference/model-call.ts\",\"packages/pi-lhc/package.json\"],\"requirementIds\":[\"AC-4.1\"],\"recommendedFixScope\":\"fresh-fix-path\",\"blocking\":false},{\"id\":\"NF-003\",\"severity\":\"observation\",\"title\":\"Derived-form reuse is deferred while fork correctness is preserved\",\"evidence\":\"packages/pi-lhc/src/lifecycle/fork.ts:141-204 seeds the forked thread by replaying source events and does not copy ready derived forms; AC-3.3 permits requeue when reuse safety cannot be proven.\",\"affectedFiles\":[\"packages/pi-lhc/src/lifecycle/fork.ts\",\"packages/pi-lhc/test/lifecycle/fork.test.ts\"],\"requirementIds\":[\"AC-3.3\",\"TC-3.3\"],\"recommendedFixScope\":\"fresh-fix-path\",\"blocking\":false}],\"unresolvedItems\":[\"Replace the simplified corpus JSONL files with real recorded PI hook/lifecycle corpora, or formally narrow AC-6.1 before passing the epic.\",\"Resolve the AC-1.5 design gap: either provide durable exact resolved-threadId reconstruction for reload or update the epic/tech design to match cwd-most-recent reattach semantics.\",\"If headless multi-candidate --resume is considered in scope for AC-1.7, add a product ruling or spec text for the current fail-closed --session path.\",\"Swap local PI/pi-ai declarations to real package imports when the PI packages become installed dependencies.\"],\"gateResult\":\"pass\"}]},\"errors\":[],\"warnings\":[],\"artifacts\":[{\"kind\":\"result-envelope\",\"path\":\"/Users/leemoore/code/pi-long-horizon/liminal-context/docs/specs/02-pi-lhc/01-connector-core/artifacts/epic/006-epic-review.json\"}],\"startedAt\":\"2026-06-14T20:42:32.898Z\",\"finishedAt\":\"2026-06-14T20:47:56.432Z\"}\n","numLines":2,"startLine":1,"totalLines":2}}}
